nd - until it did. \n\nWhen a zombie appears at his door, the bullied teen chooses to fight for survival. Teaming up with Yena, his sassy yet charming classmate, he flees the collapsing city. \n\nHunted by the infected and haunted by enemies old and new, they discover that in a world without rules, trust may be their only chance at survival.","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f33a4ea9-8afa-464c-9c36-b836d724d6e6/111e8075-a8cc-4f00-8121-c9f3097bac4f.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","fr","pt-br","tr"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.69,"follows":5343,"listAt":"2026-10-30T13:04:42.158Z","chapters":[{"id":"1a696662-f986-4ce6-a80b-73c43571d412","number":"14","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":59,"createdAt":"2025-05-28T17:32:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b509ee02-5d20-4fc7-9be7-2906bbdd74a7","number":"13","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":55,"createdAt":"2025-05-25T01:33:44+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c8de7150-934f-47e4-abe6-b2dcd6db2383","number":"12","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":53,"createdAt":"2025-05-13T17:33:11+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"89122e98-e414-4a9c-b862-300e79cb9808","number":"11","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2025-05-08T18:51:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5ba303ab-649e-4269-889c-4853b2d44c47","number":"10","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2025-05-08T18:51:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6a6184f2-3813-4d01-ac1e-ffdee8b37fe0","number":"9","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2025-05-08T18:50:54+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":6,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:08:13.257Z"},"277a7878-29c3-45dc-b0c6-955ea77353bd":{"id":"277a7878-29c3-45dc-b0c6-955ea77353bd","title":"Zense ga Saikyou Madoushi Datta Ore, Isekai Mahou de Musou suru!","altTitle":"I Was the Invincible Wizard in My Previous Life, and Now I'm Unrivaled With the Magic of Another World!","description":"\"...I remembered. I was a sage.\"\n\nOne day, on his way home, Amahito Sakuragaku, a young man looking for work to earn money for his sister's tuition, suddenly encounters a dragon. Just as he was about to be killed, his memories of his past life as a great magician return, and he easily defeats the dragon with his awakened magic. This prompted Amahito to start working as a \"slayer\" who conquers dungeons. Unlike normal slayers who can only use one ability, he uses countless magic spells and achieves extraordinary results.\n\n\"Wow... you're amazing, Onii-chan!\"\n\n\"What on earth are you...!!\"\n\nA refreshing and unrivaled fantasy where you carve out your future with the magic of your past life!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/277a7878-29c3-45dc-b0c6-955ea77353bd/ad3349fe-1b5a-4e66-98bf-223ff6e86512.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.87,"follows":4098,"listAt":"2026-10-25T18:53:13.347Z","chapters":[{"id":"19e881de-bbc5-4788-98a5-c6b9c613f3a1","number":"7","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T04:12:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f9de85b7-3ae7-415e-9a2d-cd28990f2f3b","number":"6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2026-10-10T10:31:33+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0145a486-bff6-4005-b6e8-cda403d1cafb","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-09T13:39:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"388ba47a-a897-49c2-ae35-e321cbadb291","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T14:20:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f9f1b15a-eec3-43b1-be42-eae0184b017f","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T03:10:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6212